WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.720
Yuma! Hey, Yuma!

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:08.630
Stop confining yourself up in your room
 and get down here already!

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.750
Hey, you! I know you can hear me!

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.820
At least answer me!

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.550
Um, Akari-<i>san</i>... Is Yuma still...?

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.220
Yeah, I don't really know what happened,

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.470
but he's been secluding himself in his room for days now.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:24.210
Is that so...?

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:25.910
Yuma...

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.880
<i>Hey! Astral!</i>

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.420
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.750
<i>Astral!!</i>

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:42.660
Astral...

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.750
Don Thousand.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:52.090
Why the hell did you go out of your way
 to bring me all the way out here?

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.360
This is my royal palace.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:58.840
It is a sacred ground where only those who rule the Barian World are allowed to enter.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.550
Hey now, don't tell me you brought me here just to show me this rundown...

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:04.950
What's...?!

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.880
I-It couldn't be!

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.460
This is...!

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.840
That's right. It's Number 96.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:19.250
Astral wasn't able to absorb Number 96.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:24.080
Therefore, his power came back to me instead.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.630
Why'd it come to you?

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:32.070
That's because Number 96 is a part of me.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.140
Wh-What'd you say?!

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:38.300
Long ago when I was fighting against Astral,

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:42.470
I took a portion of my power and left it inside his body.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:45.200
I guess that makes sense to me.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:49.140
So that's why a guy like Number 96 was inside Astral...

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:54.400
It is now time for us to obtain the sealed Number!

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.900
What's with this power?

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.530
So this is the power of the sealed Number?!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.460
If I have this power,

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.050
I'll go beat Yuma down right awa-

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:27.200
Have patience.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.360
Vector.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:33.840
<i>Don Thousand just left my body...!</i>

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.270
It is not yet the time for that right now.

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:41.710
We still have other things we must do!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:43.710
Things we must do?

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:45.750
This!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.090
Wh-What the hell is that?!

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:04.370
I will use this to fuse the Barian World 
and the human world into one!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:08.010
What did you say?! You can do something like that?!

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:10.620
Yes, it can be done. That is...

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:23.050
Yeah, that definitely sounds doable, but first...

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:28.490
Power! I require more power!

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:32.160
Power enough to destroy the Astral World!

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:37.200
We must amplify the evil within the human world

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.090
and along with the Barian World,

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:43.360
my strength will increase tremendously!

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:48.540
But to accomplish this, we must produce mass qualities.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.970
And there is an enormous amount of energy within it!

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:55.520
So that's why you needed Number 96's power...!

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:59.240
I must concentrate on this for a while.

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:03.560
During that time, there is something you must do.

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.330
H-Hey! Wait a minute!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:10.060
I know. You and I are of one body and soul.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:13.270
You cannot leave this place.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.140
I will grant you these Numbers.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:19.590
Now come on over to the throne.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:24.550
Employing people with bad intentions is your specialty, is it not?

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:54.780
Astral...! Why'd you go and die...?!

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:02.940
Sis was right all along.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.590
I shouldn't have kept Dueling...!

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:09.660
Then I wouldn't have to burden these painful memories!

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:12.760
These damn things...!

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:14.090
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:18.570
<i>We part ways here, Yuma.</i>

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:20.030
<i>Huh?</i>

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:23.770
<i>I entrust the Numbers to you.</i>

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.940
Even if you say that...

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:34.080
I...don't know what I'm supposed to do...!

00:05:57.060 --> 00:06:04.610
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:07.660
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:15.120
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:18.670
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:23.550
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:29.890
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:33.100
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.980
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:40.610
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.690
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:52.160
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.070
Excuse me.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:18.960
"A Pure-Hearted Duelist! Start Up the OOPArts!!"

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.460
Uh... This is a get well gift.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:20.620
Okay.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.250
Just leave it over there.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.080
Sure.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:30.970
You know, Shark... Ever since Astral died,

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.970
Yuma's been down in the dumps.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.140
- So maybe...
 - Sorry.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.890
I'm not really in the mood to talk to him right now.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.020
Th-That's true...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.100
Rio-<i>san</i>'s in bad condition...

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.610
I'm sorry.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.320
I'll excuse myself for today.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.570
I'll be back, Rio-<i>san</i>.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:56.160
What am I supposed to say to him right now?!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.870
I... I almost...!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.790
Fly Burning!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.800
Oh great Lord Vector, I came here just as you asked-

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.470
You're late!

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.180
L-Lord Vector?

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:17.810
Just what exactly is going on with you?!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.140
Wh-What are you-?!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:25.690
It's...over...flowing!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:30.780
This is...! I'm back!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.900
I returned to my original form!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.450
Thank you very much, Lord Vector!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.870
I will never forget this for as long as I live!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:42.330
If you feel that way, I have some work I need you to do for me.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:47.540
Sure thing! Just give me the order for me to obey!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:54.380
Use this thing to take the Numbers away from Yuma Tsukumo.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.890
Th-This is...

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.300
Number 1!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.890
I can't believe you gave me this valuable card!

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:05.310
I'll give you these guys as your subordinates.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.070
Y-You guys are...?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:20.950
To think that we, once known as the Four Villains of the Dark Duels, would team up again.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.290
Semimaru...

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:28.630
Lord Vector, we shall certainly live up to your expectations.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.720
Delicious!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:47.140
I made a ton of chicken nuggets, so eat as much as you want, guys!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.850
Forget Kotori's chicken nuggets!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.860
How about trying out some of my special cat rice?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:56.650
Ta-da! This time I made some special Numbers pin badges!

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.570
Naturally I have enough for everyone!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:06.160
More importantly, I've some got rare cards for you to use that I got with my sneaky tricks!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.670
Me too!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:12.800
I present you with these special exemption tickets from classroom cleaning duty!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.140
Looks like Operation Heavenly Rock Cave was a failure

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.060
Yuma...

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.770
Astral's no longer here.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.440
I can't blame him.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
Here's the finishing blow.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.640
You lose.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.720
As we agreed, I'll be taking your memories.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:16.230
An incident involving multiple Duelists with amnesia, huh?

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:20.450
Unconscious Duelists were discovered at the road during midnight.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:24.830
When the victims regained their consciousness, all of them lost their memory completely.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.410
Who could be doing this?

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:34.380
I see. So it really is true that Astral disappeared.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:39.800
That means the Barian's attacks are getting much more fierce.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:42.550
The time has come for us to move out.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:44.640
I'm entrusting Yuma to you.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.010
Roger!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.820
An incident involving Duelists losing amnesia, huh?

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.200
It must be some guys who picked a fight with a Barian, or not!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:05.370
To summarize, it's time for the Numbers Club to make an appearance after a long time!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.620
You're right. If we try hard enough,

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.290
Yuma might cheer up a little.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:15.040
Yeah! In order to help Yuma get back on his feet, this incident...

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.790
...will be solved by us!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.300
Yeah!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:27.760
Hey, Semimaru! Just what is the meaning of this?!

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.600
The meaning of what?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.230
That should be obvious!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:34.650
Our mission is to steal the Numbers from Yuma Tsukumo!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:40.320
Yet you've been attacking Duelists who have nothing to do with this night after night!

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:45.280
Don't get so worked up. That was a mere warm up.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.240
And their memories are like food to me.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.410
Human memories taste like the sweetest honey.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:57.670
I can't get enough of watching them try to squirm away as I suck it out of them.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:10.010
Whoa! That's the tag-along little girl who's always with Yuma Tsukumo!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:14.100
Those brats look like they'll make good puppets.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.610
Here's the deal.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.440
The incident involving the Duelists
 losing their memory I mentioned

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:27.570
seems to be happening somewhere near this Heartland mansion.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:28.490
Ne-ow I see.

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:30.240
Then here...

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.490
...the culprit may be hiding, or not?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:36.830
When we find him, I'll turn him
 black and blue with this frying pan!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.250
Whoa now, you've got that backwards.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.670
Have some business with me?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.360
Fly Burning!

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.400
Heartland?!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.700
It's been a while, Yuma Tsukumo.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.240
You're alive?!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:11.830
Thanks to you guys, I was sent to the Parallel Worlds.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.870
But I was resurrected thanks to Lord Vector's power!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.620
Vector?!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.080
Behold.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:23.050
I know you know who these guys are.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.890
Yuma?

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:39.060
<i>It appears these guys stuck their noses into an incident in order to cheer you up.</i>

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:45.360
<i>I thought you'd be overjoyed to hear
 that they managed to solve the case.</i>

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.110
<i>If you want to return the favor,</i>

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:53.030
<i>come to the Heartland Memorial Center 
immediately with the Numbers!</i>

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:57.500
I'm on my way, everyone!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:01.710
Good of you to come, Yuma Tsukumo.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.500
Heartland! Where are Kotori and the others?!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.170
They're right over there.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:12.050
Tokunosuke! Cat-<i>chan</i>! Hey, Tetsuo!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.600
D-Damn you...! What'd you do to them?!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.480
It was I who absorbed them.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:24.570
All those little twerps' memories, I mean!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.280
What'd you say?! You...!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.940
I'm Semimaru.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.610
If you want me to return their memories,

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.320
Duel me with the Numbers on the line.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.830
Although I say that, the outcome's already clear.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:43.880
You'll cry miserably when the Numbers are taken and you can't save your friends.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.670
And you'll lose.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:50.470
<i>A Duel betting both the Numbers and the memories of my friends...</i>

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.600
<i>Losing isn't an option...! A Duel I have to win!</i>

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.180
<i>Dammit! Why am I getting scared after all this time...?!</i>

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.680
<i>Up until now, I...</i>

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:04.860
<i>Astral...</i>

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.400
So, what'll it be?

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.160
Now just hold on, Semimaru.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.580
There's no need to corner him so much.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.830
Just think it over for a minute.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:27.130
The Numbers war is an issue between the Barian World and the Astral World in the first place.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.380
it should have nothing to do with a human like you.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.670
Plus, now that Astral is no longer here,

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:36.510
wouldn't you say you no longer have
 any need to protect the Numbers?

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.220
Well...

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.890
I'm a rather kind man.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.850
If you simply hand over the Numbers,

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:46.230
I'll promise to keep my hands off you guys from now on.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.770
And of course, we'll return the memories of your friends.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:55.360
That's right! We can also have the memories you hold of Astral erased from your memory!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.990
Anyone would rather forget such painful memories.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:05.370
It's natural that you'd only want to
 remember the pleasant memories.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.790
If I erase all of them,

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:14.470
you'll return to the calm and peaceful world you knew before meeting Astral.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.340
Before I met Astral...

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.310
I can't do that.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.230
Huh?

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:32.570
It's true that the stuff between the Barian World and the Astral World have nothing to do with me!

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:37.740
But the Numbers are something Astral left with me!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:45.910
To me and Astral, the Numbers represent what we spent everything fighting for!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.750
And I can't just give them to you people!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.090
That's right, Yuma!

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.050
You are...!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.390
III!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.690
Yuma! I clearly heard your determination!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.730
If you've got the feelings to fight for what you want to protect,

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.650
I'll become your sword and the shield to protect you!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:16.950
Huh?!

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:23.990
After the last incident, my brothers and I spent all our time researching the Astral World and the Barian World.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:29.250
And while investigating, we learned that you lost Astral.

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:34.340
Yuma, you are the first friend I met.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.720
I can't just ignore your sadness!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.010
III, you...

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:45.600
What can the three sons of your rug rat papa possibly do?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:49.020
We're able to crush some comical fly wearing glasses!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:52.270
Drat! You've got a loose mouth for such a cute face!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:01.910
What?!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.410
Why are you still able to use the power of the Crests?!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:12.040
It's thanks to this bracelet my big brother made.

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:18.720
Through the power of science, he was able to place the power of the crests my dad gave us inside them.

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.970
The power...he gave you...

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:25.890
Yuma... I may not be able to help replace Astral,

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:28.770
but I can help you Duel these guys!

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.850
In the past, you fought me with your life on the line.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:37.030
But now I'll fight alongside you as a friend!

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:40.490
Fight alongside me as a friend...

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:41.990
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.240
<i>I entrust the Numbers to you.</i>

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:50.620
III!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:53.460
What's that?

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.710
When Astral left the Numbers with me,

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.380
I'm sure he meant to use this power justly!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:04.590
So I'll split this power up between my friends
 and fight alongside them!

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.720
Yuma...

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:14.100
I'm not sure if this is the right choice or not,

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.020
but this is my answer for now!

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:21.610
It seems that you're about ready to Duel!

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.990
Fine! Why not?!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:31.460
Fine by me. Feel free to attack two-on-one!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.580
You'll end up regretting that statement!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.500
Let's do it, III!

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:37.420
Yeah!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.510
Duel Disk, set!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.600
D-Gazer, set!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:20:59.980
Duel!!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:06.660
Semimaru! Allow me to flower up your battlefield a bit!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:13.160
My clansmen! Carve the seal of wickedness within the earth!

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.250
Wh-What's up with this?!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.790
Within this field, at the same time the Duel begins,

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:23.670
Semimaru can take half your Life Points and add them to his!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.090
That's dirty!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:27.300
Yeah, it certainly is dirty.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:31.220
But more than that, aren't these guys more of a problem?!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:54.660
My image was broken?!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.840
So that's his...

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.300
...true form...

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:23.610
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:26.150
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:27.360
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:28.780
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:31.660
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:34.160
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:36.710
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:37.790
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:38.830
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.210
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.550
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:47.670
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:49.890
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:54.850
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:56.220
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.100
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.390 --> 00:23:02.400
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:07.490
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:08.740
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:12.740
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:18.120
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.460
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:25.630
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:27.840
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:42.150
Tagging alongside III,

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:43.940
we begin a Duel against Semimaru.

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:47.530
Heartland took away half our Life,

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.820
but my vigor with III still won't be stopped!

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:52.820
Even if Astral isn't here...!

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:54.990
I came here to fight alongside you!

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:57.040
III! Use that!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:58.290
I understand, Yuma!

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:00.830
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:04.750
"The Power of a New Hope!!
 Combination of Friendship - "Atlantal Hope""

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:08.460
I'll show you! This is our power of friendship!
